1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,080
That night she sits alone on a bench under a live oak, more confused than she has ever been.

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:13,177
A red point of light approaches: a lighted cigar, so it must be Gouvernail, because her husband does not smoke.

3
00:00:13,177 --> 00:00:17,981
He sits beside her, and in the dark his reserve melts, and he talks.

